{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52041","headline":"自答 · 王绩","name":"自答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公子澹无爲，非关怀□移。\n老莱犹[有]（据李抄本补）妇，王霸岂无儿。\n人世何劳隔，生涯故可知。\n溪流无限水，树长自然枝。\n竹林横□□，梧桐倚惠施。\n杨朱那早计，烦此泣途歧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}